DESCRIPTION:Join us for a weekend at Waycross helping to start new project
 s as well as with ongoing efforts around our facility! We’ll offer a var
 iety of work for all skill levels. Bring your passion and talent for a fun
 \, active\, community filled weekend.\nVolunteer Weekends are free and inc
 lude meals and lodging. Registration is required so that we can make enoug
 h food to feed everyone!!\n\n\nSeptember 25-27\, 2026\n\n\nCheck-in: 4-6pm
 \n\n\nCheck-out: 11:30am\n\n\n\n\nAll ages welcome\, minors must be accomp
 anied by an adult.\n\n\nAccommodation options:\n\n\nMain House/Sleeping Wi
 ng – Multi-Occupancy\n\n\nCabins – Multi-Occupancy\n\n\nCommuter – C
 ome work with the crew on Saturday only (lunch provided)\n\n\n\n\n
