SUMMARY:Drink at the Creek Concert: The Woomblies Rock Orchestra & Atom He
 art Mother (Pink Floyd)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260926T000000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260926T000000
UID:260924iwAK_FxZQE-_haX45mw8bQ
DESCRIPTION:This year's Drink at the Creek Concert Series will once again 
 bring you live music events in a gorgeous setting with a wide variety of p
 erformers taking the stage at Cedar Creek Winery\, Brew Co and Distillery\
 , just outside of Martinsville. Be sure to mark your calendar with the dat
 es below! As always\, this is an all ages music series and tickets are $15
  in advance per person for each show with a season ticket option available
 . $20 at the gate. Kids 12 and under are free! Coolers must be 12" x 15" o
 r smaller\; no outside alcohol allowed. No pets. Concerts typically begin 
 at 6 pm. Anyone on the grounds after 4 pm must have a concert ticket. The 
 series kicks off this year on May 16 and runs through Oct. 3. See the comp
 lete list of dates below: 2026 Drink at the Creek Concert Series May 23 Th
 understruck: America's AC/DC & Sabbath “Long Live Ozzy” June 6 Pandora
 's Box \\(Aerosmith\\) & Whitesnaked \\(Whitesnake\\) June 27 World Turnin
 g \\(Fleetwood Mac\\) & Those Damn Torpedoes \\(Tom Petty\\) July 31 Journ
 ey From The Heart \\(Journey & Heart\\) & Fancy Sauce Aug. 8 Tennessee Whi
 skey \\(Chris Stapleton\\) & Ultimate Church \\(Eric Church\\) Aug. 29 Nig
 ht Moves \\(Bob Seger\\) & Bell Bottom Revival \\(Lainey Wilson\\) Sept. 5
  Henry Lee Summer\, Mellencougar \\(Mellencamp\\)\, & Brandon Santini Sept
 . 26 The Woomblies Rock Orchestra & Atom Heart Mother \\(Pink Floyd\\) Oct
 . 3 Hairbangers Ball & The Big 80s - Big Green Egg Cookout\\* Oct. 17 Fami
 ly Tradition \\(Hank Williams Jr.\\) & Eliminator \\(ZZ Top\\)
URL:https://www.visitmorgancountyin.com/event/drink-at-the-creek-concert%3
 a-the-woomblies-rock-orchestra-%26-atom-heart-mother-(pink-floyd)/11382/
X-SOURCE:Limestone Post, Visit Morgan County
END:VEVENT
