BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Brown County State Park": "https://browncountymtb.org/brown-county-epic"}
X-SOURCE-ID:localist_brown_county_sp
SUMMARY:2026 Brown County Epic\, Brown County State Park
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260926T073000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260926T193000
UID:2dfcd7715461b0b3dff25d700ff8ee48@events.in.gov
DESCRIPTION:2026 Brown County Epic The Epic is one of Indiana&rsquo\;s lon
 gest-running and best mountain bike festivals &mdash\; a true grassroots e
 vent\, &nbsp\;brought to you by Brown County Mountain Biking \, the non-pr
 ofit organization who stewards the trails we all love. Every dollar raised
  goes right back into Brown County trail building and maintenance.&nbsp\; 
 Registration available at the event. Pre-registration is encouraged:&nbsp\
 ; https://www.bikereg.com/browncountyepic#Notes ------------- Experience t
 he best mountain biking in the Midwest at the Brown County Epic Mountain B
 ike Festival\, September 25-27\, 2026 . Located in Brown County State Park
 \, the 2026 Mountain Bike Festival and Epic Ride will offer tons of flowin
 g single track during prime Autumn riding season. The Epic Ride with SAG s
 upport will take place on Saturday\, September 26. Routes of 26 - 73 miles
  will be available for all participants. This is not a race\, just a ride 
 in the woods with friends! The trails at Brown County State Park exist bec
 ause of the work of&nbsp\;many volunteers and Brown County Mountain Biking
 . This event supports those efforts and more. Vendors will be back in 2026
 ! The Epic Ride routes will be posted on Trailforks. The complete routes w
 ill not be marked in the woods. Please download the GPS routes\, print map
 s\, and use the Trailforks app. **The Long Route will include Trail D\, Ne
 bo\, and Combs which are in Hoosier National Forest. Your entrance fee wil
 l allow you to ride in Hoosier National Forest but you must carry a Hoosie
 r National Forest Trail Pass\, which will be provided by BCMB. T-shirts wi
 ll be guaranteed for those who register before 11:59 PM\, August 31. Regis
 ter early to guarantee your t-shirt and save money before price increases!
  Special event Tent camping will be available by the pool Friday and Satur
 day and must be purchased via BikeReg. We&#39\;ll have food trucks on site
  throughout the weekend.
LOCATION:Brown County State Park\, 1405 S.R. 46 W\, Nashville\, IN 
URL:https://browncountymtb.org/brown-county-epic
X-SOURCE:Brown County State Park
END:VEVENT
