X-SOURCE-URLS:{"IU Bloomington Libraries": "https://events.iu.edu/libraries/event/2398776-saturday-crafternoon", "WFHB Community Calendar": "https://wfhb.org/events/saturday-crafternoon-2/"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Events Livewhale 261": "https://events.iu.edu/libraries/event/2398776-saturday-crafternoon"}
X-SOURCE-ID:events_livewhale_261
SUMMARY:Saturday Crafternoon
DTSTART:20260926T150000Z
DTEND:20260926T180000Z
DTSTAMP:20260827T165859Z
UID:20260926T150000Z-2398776@events.iu.edu
RECURRENCE-ID:20260926T150000Z
ATTACH:https://events.iu.edu/live/image/gid/261/width/168/height/168/crop/
 1/src_region/0,0,1772,1772/32241_Crafternoons-notebook.JPEG
CATEGORIES:Art and museum exhibitions,Community events
DESCRIPTION:We have a wide variety of artifacts\, photographs\, and archiv
 al materials (documents and important papers!) saved by the Wylie family a
 nd available to be used for research\, teaching\, or even as inspiration f
 or painting! Join us in September as we explore our online archival collec
 tion and create custom notebooks for the new school year.  Saturday Crafte
 rnoons are a free event for families\, students\, and friends of all ages!
  Activities change monthly. Check the Wylie House Museum socials and websi
 te for updated information\, parking information\, and museum tour hours.
GEO:39.161697;-86.5309
LAST-MODIFIED:20260827T205921Z
LOCATION:WYLIE HOUSE (307 E. SECOND STREET)
URL:https://events.iu.edu/libraries/event/2398776-saturday-crafternoon
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  We have a wide variety of artifacts\, ph
 otographs\, and archival materials (documents and important papers!) saved
  by the Wylie family and available to be used for research\, teaching\, or
  even as inspiration for painting! Join us in September as we explore our 
 online archival collection and create custom notebooks for the new school 
 year.</p><p>  Saturday Crafternoons are a free event for families\, studen
 ts\, and friends of all ages! Activities change monthly. Check the Wylie H
 ouse Museum socials and website for updated information\, parking informat
 ion\, and museum tour hours.</p>
X-LIVEWHALE-CONTACT-INFO:<p>\n  Wylie House Museum\, <a href="mailto:libwy
