 ew mural by local artist Journey Matthews\, with a reception outside Soma 
 Coffeehouse's new location at the Kiln\, live music from The Sera-Tones (4
 :30pm) and Amy O (5:30pm)\, hands on tech from RoboBoosters FIRST Robotics
  teams\, IU's Center of Excellence for Women & Technology\, IU Game Design
  Capstones\, and Luddy 3D Fabrication\, local food trucks\, Upland Brewing
  Co. (21+)\, arts and crafts\, face painting\, balloon sculptures\, and Tr
 ades District trivia.\n\nFree and open to the public. RSVP: https://forms.
