CATEGORIES:Cultural
DESCRIPTION:Hosted by CSSA@IU\, our Mid-Autumn roaming fair welcomes all I
 U students to experience traditional Chinese festival culture. At the hea
 rt of the event are six interactive challenge stations themed around Mid-
 Autumn traditions. Attendees are free to wander throughout the venue\, jo
 in culturally inspired mini-games at each booth\, and take part in a fun 
 stamp-collecting activity as they explore different stations.\nComplement
 ing the game booths\, we will have a lineup of song and dance performance
 s themed around Mid-Autumn Festival on stage. The event creates a relaxed
 \, immersive space for students of all backgrounds to learn about Chinese
  traditions and connect with one another. Participants will move freely b
 etween activity areas to experience the full atmosphere of the festival.\
 n\nHosted by: Chinese Students and Scholars Association\n\nAdditional Inf
 ormation can be found at: https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12814121
DTEND:20260926T200000Z
DTSTAMP:20260926T045204Z
