DESCRIPTION:The annual Old Town Waverly Festival includes demonstrations a
 nd reenactments of Backwoodsman\, Blacksmithing\, weaving\, competitions\,
  live music and more. View historical items located in the Waverly Museum 
 which was the Old Town Waverly Bank building or wander and enjoy the antiq
 ue tractor display and vendor booths. Old Town Waverly Park is a place to 
 re-connect with nature and history. Stop by on Saturday\, from 9 am to 6 p
 m or Sunday\, from 10:30 am to 4 pm. 2026 Schedule Ongoing Activities \\(b
 oth days\\): Craft/Art Vendors\, Traditional Craft Demonstrations\, Food C
 ourt Vendors\, Historical Encampments\, Farm Town\, Kids Town\, Historic H
 ayrides\, & Riverview Golf Cart Tours. Saturday: 8 -11 am - Community Brea
 kfast\, Historical Methodist Church 9:55 am - Muzzleloader salute 10 am - 
 Vendors open\, Town Square 10 am - Flag Raising by Boy Scout Troop 231 Pat
 riotic music from Woodbridge Music Academy 10:15 am - Welcome and Celebrat
 ion of 250 years of our Independence 10:30-11 am - Music by Woodridge Musi
 c Academy 11 am - Old West Bank Robbery Re-enactment 11 am-Noon - Isaac De
 ak\, Roaming Fiddler 12-1 pm - Apple Pickers Dulcimer Society 12-1 pm - Na
 il Driving Contest\, Kids Town 1-2 pm - Isaac Deak\, Roaming Fiddler 1-3 p
 m - Studio J2 Dance - Pre-professional dance group 2 pm - Old West Bank Ro
 bbery Re-enactment 2:30 pm - Tug o' War Contest\, Kids Town 3:30-5:30 pm -
  Waverly Elementary School Choir & MSGER 3:50 pm - Old West Bank Robbery\,
  re-enactment 4:30-5 pm - Sack Race\, Kids Town 6 pm - Vendors Close Sunda
 y: 8-11 am - Community Breakfast by Mooresville Lions\, Food Court 9 am-3 
 pm- 5th Annual Car Show Registration by Hoosier Coachman 10:55 am - Muzzle
 loader salute 11 am - Vendors Open 11 am-Noon - Isaac Deak\, Roaming Fiddl
 er 11:00 am-1:30 pm Music: Reva Brummett/Cowboy 11:15-11:45 am - Sack Race
 \, Kid’s Town 11:50 Old West Bank Robbery Re-enactment 12-3 pm - Car Sho
 w 12:30-1:30 pm - Nail Driving Contest\, Kids Town 2:50 pm - Old West Bank
  Robbery Re-enactment 3 pm - Car Show Awards 4 pm - Vendors Close
URL:https://www.visitmorgancountyin.com/event/2026-old-town-waverly-park-f
 estival/11398/
