DESCRIPTION:🍀 Wanna Get Lucky at Plant Bingo?\nJoin Mossy Rock Pottery 
 for an evening where bingo blooms a little greener! Instead of ordinary pr
 izes\, you’ll play 10 exciting rounds for the chance to win beautiful pl
 ants while enjoying the laid-back atmosphere of the Ferguson Beer Garden. 
 Every guest receives a goodie bag\, and cold beer is available for purchas
 e to keep the good times flowing.\nWhether you’re a seasoned plant paren
 t\, a bingo enthusiast\, or just looking for a unique night out with frien
 ds\, Plant Bingo is the perfect mix of laughter\, friendly competition\, a
 nd leafy treasures. It’s a chance to relax\, sip\, cheer\, and maybe eve
 n head home with your new favorite houseplant.\nJoin us the last Sunday of
  every month from 5:00–7:00 PM for just $25 and discover why everyone le
 aves with a smile (and maybe a plant or two!).\n🍀 It’s the most fun y
 ou can have in Nashville\, Indiana on a Sunday night!\n
