DESCRIPTION:Join us on Sunday\, September 27\, at 3:30 p.m. in Ballantine 
 Hall (room BH005) for a guest lecture/workshop given by Juan Felipe Mende
 z Fonseca\, the amazing social media manager of @indiana_guitar - the IU 
 Guitar Department's official Instagram page!\nFrom gear and recording to 
 editing\, collaboration\, and marketing\, this workshop will cover both t
 he creative and practical sides of content creation\; whether you’re look
 ing to build your personal social media presence\, expand your band’s aud
 ience\, or simply learn more about producing and promoting musical conten
 t\, you’ll leave with useful ideas and techniques you can apply right awa
 y!\nSince this will be an interactive workshop\, it is recommended (but n
 ot mandatory) to bring your laptop and have DaVinci Resolve installed - y
 ou can download it HERE!\n \nLooking forward to seeing you there! \nIU Gu
 itar Club\n\nHosted by: Indiana University Guitar Club\n\nAdditional Info
 rmation can be found at: https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12759486
