DESCRIPTION:Stop by the 10th and Fee (entrance to arboretum) to help raise
  awareness for suicide prevention. Tuesday Sep 10 is World Suicide Preven
 tion Day. Help us reach our goal of lighting up 1\,100 luminaries to memo
 rialize the 1\,100 college students who lose their lives to suicide each 
 year.\nParticipation is easy: decorate a bag (or a few) with a positive m
 essage or drawing\, get a scoop of sand\, put a light inside\, and place 
 your bag on the edge of the sidewalk in the arboretum. At dusk we will tu
 rn on all the lights\, so stop by to witness all the bags lit up or look 
 out for pictures on our Instagram @balanceatkelley.\n\nHosted by: Balance
  at Kelley\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https://beinvolved.
 indiana.edu/event/12810359
