UID:20260928T160000Z-2314890@events.iu.edu
RECURRENCE-ID:20260928T160000Z
CATEGORIES:Lectures, talks, seminars, and conferences
DESCRIPTION:Navigating the intersection of patents\, regulation\, and comm
 ercial strategy in cancer diagnostics requires a distinct legal strategy. 
 Join us as Sarah Kelly\, Ph.D.\, J.D. shares how legal practice adapts to 
 rapid R&amp\;D\, evolving patent strategies\, restrictive profit margins (
 due to revenue depending on Medicare reimbursements)\, and data privacy in
  this fast-paced field. Ms. Kelley's talk will include discussion of how h
 er practice interacts with regulatory compliance\, privacy and data protec
 tion\, commercialization\, and reimbursement.&#160\;  Hosted by Center for
  IP Research\, Maurer Health Law Student Association\, and the Intellectua
 l Property Association  Lunch provided with RSVP by Friday\, September 25t
 h.
