  regulation\, and commercial strategy in cancer diagnostics requires a dis
 tinct legal strategy. Join us as Sarah Kelly\, Ph.D.\, J.D. shares how leg
 al practice adapts to rapid R&amp\;D\, evolving patent strategies\, restri
 ctive profit margins (due to revenue depending on Medicare reimbursements)
 \, and data privacy in this fast-paced field. Ms. Kelley's talk will inclu
 de discussion of how her practice interacts with regulatory compliance\, p
 rivacy and data protection\, commercialization\, and reimbursement.&#160\;
 </p><p>  Hosted by Center for IP Research\, Maurer Health Law Student Asso
 ciation\, and the Intellectual Property Association</p><p>  Lunch provided
  with RSVP by Friday\, September 25<sup>th</sup>.</p>
