BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-ID:gcal_d1087e97d4ace1c1ca2dd6336d417bea870ddac277be6d1711cbc0235aa85228
SUMMARY:Board of Park Commissioners Special Meeting: 2026 Investment Prior
 ities Plan
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260928T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260928T190000
DTSTAMP:20260926T045135Z
UID:d2buta923src0nhj29snqlbp4s@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20260928T173000
SEQUENCE:0
CREATED:20260924T122301Z
DESCRIPTION:The Bloomington Board of Park Commissioners holds a special me
 eting to review the Parks and Recreation Department's proposed 2026 Invest
 ment Priorities Plan\, a supplement to the 2026-2030 Parks and Recreation 
 Master Plan. The plan covers how to invest in and maintain aging parks\, p
 laygrounds\, trails\, and recreation facilities.\n\nNo final action on the
  plan is scheduled. Public comment is part of the agenda\, and an online o
 ption to review the information and submit comments is expected to open af
 ter the meeting.\n\nWatch live on CATS TV: https://catstv.net/\n\nAgenda: 
 https://bloomington.in.gov/onboard/meetingFiles/17513/download\nBoard page
 : https://bloomington.in.gov/boards/park-commissioners
LAST-MODIFIED:20260925T133856Z
LOCATION:Switchyard Park Pavilion\, 1601 S. Rogers St.\, Bloomington\, IN 
 47403
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-SOURCE:BloomingtonOnline Events
END:VEVENT
