 me ready to share with employers? Stop by Kirkwood Hall for a <strong>Care
 er Fair Resume Drop-In</strong> for quick\, personalized feedback before m
 eeting with recruiters. A career coach will help you strengthen your resum
 es\, highlight your most relevant experiences\, and make last-minute impro
 vements so you can attend the fair with confidence.&#160\;</p><p><strong>W
 ho should attend:&#160\;</strong><br />  Students from any major who plan 
 to attend the Retail Career Fair and/or the Fine Arts Career Fair that wou
 ld like brief resume feedback before connecting with employers.&#160\;</p>
 <p>  No appointment is required. Bring a printed or digital copy of your r
 esume.&#160\;</p><p>  Can't make it? Attend the other <strong><a href="htt
 ps://events.iu.edu/iuwalter/event/2380053-retail-and-fine-arts-career-fair
 -prep-resume">Career Fair Prep: Resume Drop-In</a> on Tuesday\, September 
 29</strong>&#160\;or stop by Ernie Pyle Hall for <a href="https://careers.
 college.indiana.edu/about/explore-our-center/drop-in-coaching/index.html">
 drop-in coaching</a> from 10am-4pm any weekday during the school year.&#16
 0\;</p><p>  This event is Momentum eligible.</p>
