SUMMARY:Story: Sajik Kim exhibition
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260929
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260930
DTSTAMP:20260818T163935Z
UID:20260929T040000Z-2385188@events.iu.edu
