UID:20260929T140000Z-2385093@events.iu.edu
RECURRENCE-ID:20260929T140000Z
CATEGORIES:Career development
DESCRIPTION:Career fair season is here! Is your resume ready to share with
  employers? Stop in the Fine Arts Building&#160\;for quick\, personalized 
 feedback before meeting with recruiters. A career coach will help you stre
 ngthen your resume\, highlight your most relevant experiences\, and make l
 ast-minute improvements so you can attend the fair with confidence.&#160\;
 Who should attend:&#160\;  Students from any major who plan to attend the 
 Retail Career Fair and/or Fine Arts Career Fair that would like brief resu
 me feedback before connecting with employers.&#160\;  No appointment is re
 quired. Bring a printed or digital copy of your resume.&#160\;  Can't make
  it? Attend the other Career Fair Prep: Resume Drop-In (https://events.iu.
 edu/iuwalter/event/2380051-retail-fine-arts-career-fair-prep-resume) on Mo
 nday\, September 28 or stop by Ernie Pyle Hall for drop-in coaching (https
 ://careers.college.indiana.edu/about/explore-our-center/drop-in-coaching/i
 ndex.html) from 10am-4pm any weekday during the school year.&#160\;  This 
 event is Momentum eligible.&#160\;
GEO:39.169111;-86.518919
LAST-MODIFIED:20260818T173021Z
LOCATION:FINE ARTS BUILDING
URL:https://events.iu.edu/live/events/2380053-retail-and-fine-arts-career-
 fair-prep-resume
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Career fair season is here! Is your resu
 me ready to share with employers? Stop in the Fine Arts Building&#160\;for
  quick\, personalized feedback before meeting with recruiters. A career co
 ach will help you strengthen your resume\, highlight your most relevant ex
 periences\, and make last-minute improvements so you can attend the fair w
 ith confidence.&#160\;</p><p><strong>Who should attend:&#160\;</strong><br
  />  Students from any major who plan to attend the Retail Career Fair and
 /or Fine Arts Career Fair that would like brief resume feedback before con
 necting with employers.&#160\;</p><p>  No appointment is required. Bring a
  printed or digital copy of your resume.&#160\;</p><p>  Can't make it? Att
 end the other <strong><a href="https://events.iu.edu/iuwalter/event/238005
 1-retail-fine-arts-career-fair-prep-resume">Career Fair Prep: Resume Drop-
 In</a> on Monday\, September 28</strong> or stop by Ernie Pyle Hall for <a
  href="https://careers.college.indiana.edu/about/explore-our-center/drop-i
 n-coaching/index.html">drop-in coaching</a> from 10am-4pm any weekday duri
 ng the school year.&#160\;</p><p>  This event is Momentum eligible.&#160\;
 </p>
