DESCRIPTION:Did you know you can spend a semester or summer living\, inter
 ning\, and building a professional network in Washington\, D.C. through th
 e Hamilton Lugar School?  Whether you are actively planning your applicati
 on for Spring or Summer 2027 or just curious about how an HLS D.C. experie
 nce fits your degree\, drop in&#160\;for a fast-tracked 15-minute tune-up 
 session.  In Just 15 Minutes:Free Professional Headshot for LinkedIn\, Han
 dshake &amp\; applications  Resume Feedback geared toward internships\, go
 vernment\, NGOs &amp\; policy careers    D.C. Program Match with the HLS W
 ashington\, D.C. Global Policy Program (https://hls.indiana.edu/careers/dc
 -global-policy-program/index.html) – explore how this opportunity opens 
 doors to high-impact internships and career networks in the nation's capit
 al.      Claim Your Spot:Reserve Time Slot: Complete the registration form
  and lock in your 15-minute appointment block:    Registration Form:https:
 //forms.gle/1zckFZ1t1BNe1gW6A (https://forms.gle/1zckFZ1t1BNe1gW6A)Bring P
 rinted Resume: You must bring 1 hard copy of your resume draft for on-the-
 spot red-pen feedback.    Dress Waist-Up Professional: Wear a professional
  top\, collared shirt\, or blazer (headshots are framed waist-up).    Chec
 k In: Arrive 5 minutes early to the check-in desk outside room HLSRoom 213
 4.
