DESCRIPTION:The AI in Business Society is hosting Josh Burgin\, Managing D
 irector of Cloud and AI Platforms at Microsoft\, for a conversation on ho
 w enterprises are actually adopting AI. Josh leads engagements that help 
 large organizations move AI from pilot to production\, and he works direc
 tly with the teams deciding where these tools create real business value.
  He will talk through what he is seeing across the market\, how AI is cha
 nging the way companies operate and buy technology\, and what skills matt
 er for students entering the field. The session will close with open Q&A\
 , so come with questions. Open to all majors. No prior AI experience requ
 ired.\n\nHosted by: Association for Business Analytics\, AI in Business S
 ociety\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https://beinvolved.indi
 ana.edu/event/12782840
DTEND:20261001T003000Z
DTSTAMP:20260926T045204Z
