BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Browncounty": "https://browncounty.com/events/backroads-studio-tour/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:browncounty
SUMMARY:Backroads Studio Tour
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261001T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261031T210000
DTSTAMP:20260527T112120Z
UID:MEC-100f82e1e7a4c009dbdf2e5f38a68fed@browncounty.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261001T140000
SEQUENCE:1
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://browncounty.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/
 05/BVB-Outdoors-Fall-Country-Road-Orange_CHP-scaled.jpg
CATEGORIES:Art Events &amp\; Exhibits,Classes &amp\; Workshops,Fall,Family
  Friendly,Free,Happening,Special Events,Tours
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260527
DESCRIPTION:Come and see live artist studios in Brown County\, Indiana.\nW
 orking artists will welcome visitors throughout the month of October. Juri
 ed artisans\, a true representation of the arts in Brown County\, will sha
 re a special glimpse into the lives of working artists and craftsmen.  Do
 n’t miss the 100th Anniversary of the Brown County Art Gallery while you
 ’re here.\nThe Back Roads of Brown County Studio Tour is a free\, self-g
 uided event designed to showcase the arts and crafts created in the presen
 t-day “Art Colony of the Midwest.”\nWatch artwork take shape before y
 our eyes\, with artists and craftsmen demonstrating daily. Talk with artis
 ts and explore the spaces that inspire them. At some studios\, you might e
 ven be able to take part in the creation in prepared activities. Education
 al and designed to broaden public understanding of the arts\, the tour is 
 an art celebration for the whole family.\nThis is a unique opportunity to
  meet artists doing what they love and to purchase artwork directly from t
 hose who made it. Collectors will relish the selection of new work made a
 vailable especially for this event.\nAll studios are open Wednesday – S
 aturday 10:00am – 5:00pm daily in October. Many studios are open Sunday 
 10:00 am – 5:00 pm. Check the artist listing here ( https://bcstudiotou
 r.com/artists/ ) for hours for each studio.\nMost studios take credit car
 d payments\, but some do not\, often because of limited internet service i
 n backroads art studios. So\, bring your checkbook or some extra cash alon
 g\, just in case!\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20260527
LOCATION:Brown County
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://browncounty.com/events/backroads-studio-tour/
X-SOURCE:Brown County Events
END:VEVENT
