DESCRIPTION: \n\nMeet with peers\, grab some FREE pizza from Quarry Pie Co
 .\, and discover resources to help you succeed at IU and beyond!\nStop by
  the Georgian Room in the Indiana Memorial Union from 11 a.m.–1 p.m. to c
 onnect with peer support programs from across campus. Learn how your fell
 ow students can help you explore careers\, get involved on campus and in 
 the community\, succeed academically\, explore education abroad\, and bui
 ld financial wellness.\nParticipating peer programs include:\n\nCareer Pe
 ers\nInvolvement Ambassadors\nIU Corps Volunteer Interns\nPeer Academic C
 oaches\nEducation Abroad Peer Ambassadors\nMoneySmarts Student Financial 
 Educators\n\nTake part in our Passport to Pizza activity by visiting each
  peer group and collecting a stamp. Once your passport is complete\, you’
 ll be entered into a drawing for a chance to win an IU Goody Bag!\nAll IU
  students are welcome. Come for the pizza\, stay to meet your peers and d
 iscover services designed to help you make the most of your IU experience
 .\n\n \n\nHosted by: IU Corps\, Office of Student Life\, Undergraduate Ed
 ucation\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https://beinvolved.ind
 iana.edu/event/12813478
