DESCRIPTION:October Theme: Math Day: Thursday Time: 4 - 5:45pm Recommended
  Ages: Designed for children ages 6 - 10\, but siblings are welcome. Locat
 ion: WonderLab Cost: Free for Members / Free with Museum Admission Curiosi
 ty Lab is an after-school\, free play program for kids ages 6-10 years. Ch
 ildren are invited to explore\, experiment\, and engage in hands-on sensor
 y activities at their own pace. No instructions\, no pressure-just curiosi
 ty-driven play. Held in WonderLab \\(or sometimes outdoors weather permitt
 ing\\)\, the space is set up for exploration with a variety of rotating ma
 terials and stations. There will be one main activity/installment/manipula
 tive for the month that will be brought out every Thursday. This will rota
 te with the month and the month's theme.
