DESCRIPTION:Join IUSG and RHA for an interactive Red Zone Awareness event 
 focused on building a safer campus community through education and engage
 ment. Participants will move through five self-paced stations covering Re
 d Zone awareness\, consent education\, and bystander intervention\, while
  enjoying activities\, giveaways\, prizes\, and free resources. Designed 
 to reinforce important concepts introduced during It's On Us training\, t
 his event helps students recognize risk factors\, practice healthy relati
 onship skills\, and learn how to support their peers.\n\nHosted by: India
 na University Student Government\, Residence Hall Association\n\nAddition
 al Information can be found at: https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/1281
 9166
