SUMMARY: Nevere's Love Potion
DESCRIPTION:Nevere is the brightest young witch at Spellwright School for
  Wizardry\, she's got her best friend Taolo\, a slightly annoying familia
 r Cletus\, and her loving-if-out-of-touch mom--so why does she feel like 
 something is really wrong? After a school assembly about the dangers of l
 ove potions\, Nevere snatches her professor's spell book\, just a week be
 fore the Spring Fling. While giving someone else a love potion may be kin
 da dicey\, what if you could make a love potion . . . for yourself?\n\nDi
 rected by Andrew Keeler\n\nMusic Direction by Kyla Sherry\n\nChoreographe
 d by Jada Buehler\n\nBook By Annalise Cain\nMusic by Devin McDuffy\nLyric
 s By Annalise Cain and Devin McDuffy\n\nIn the fall of 2025\, Stages Bloo
 mington presented a staged concert reading of the never-before-seen music
 al with 8 Bloomington teens. We're so excited to be staging the world pre
 miere of this musical!\n\n
CATEGORIES:Theatre,Bloomington
