DESCRIPTION:Join this symposium to celebrate the Chiricú (https://scholar
 works.iu.edu/iupjournals/index.php/chiricu/index) academic journal. There 
 will be a virtual presentation with IU alum and scholar\, Norma Alarcón a
 nd a presentation by award winning author\, Edgar Gómez.&#160\;Chiricú J
 ournal invites scholarly and creative submissions on any facet of Latinx l
 ives\, literatures\, and cultures. Original scholarship and works of art\,
  poetry\, fiction\, non-fiction essays\, and interviews may be submitted i
 n Spanish\, Portuguese\, Indigenous languages\, French or English.
