 ><a href="https://scholarworks.iu.edu/iupjournals/index.php/chiricu/index"
 >Chiricú</a></em> academic journal. There will be a virtual presentation 
 with IU alum and scholar\, Norma Alarcón and a presentation by award winn
 ing author\, Edgar Gómez.&#160\;</p><p><em>Chiricú Journal</em> invites 
 scholarly and creative submissions on any facet of Latinx lives\, literatu
 res\, and cultures. Original scholarship and works of art\, poetry\, ficti
 on\, non-fiction essays\, and interviews may be submitted in Spanish\, Por
 tuguese\, Indigenous languages\, French or English.</p>
