DESCRIPTION:You'll visit the Lilly's main galleries\, and your expert guid
 e will talk about some of the Lilly's highlights including the Gutenberg B
 ible&#160\;and our current exhibitions from the Lilly Library collections:
  The Declaration of Independence: The Motives\, the Moment (https://librar
 ies.indiana.edu/lilly-library/declaration-independence) and The Signers (h
 ttps://libraries.indiana.edu/lilly-library/the-signers). Additional hands-
 on time with rotating selections from the collections will follow. These s
 elections include medieval manuscripts\, artists books\, and one of the Jo
 hn Ford's Best Director Oscars. Non-flash photography is permitted\, seati
 ng is available throughout the tour\, and the building is wheelchair acces
 sible. The tour generally lasts a little less than one hour and is open to
  all.
