SUMMARY: GALLERY WALK! BOUND BY NATURE
DESCRIPTION:Bound by Nature\n\n20 Original Ornamental Insect Illustration
 s\n\nby Jonathan Nash\n\nOpening Reception:\n\nFirst Friday Gallery Walk\
 , Oct 2\, 5-8:00pm\n\nSpecial music by Elias Fisher\, 6-7:30pm\n\nBound b
 y Nature is a commissioned series of twenty original Art Nouveau-inspired
  illustrations created for the wedding of Erica Nadolkski and Jordan Evan
 s.\n\nEach poster celebrates a different insect personally selected by th
 e bride\, pairing it with native flora and elements of its natural habita
 t. Drawing inspiration from vintage natural history plates and the decora
 tive compositions of the Art Nouveau movement\, every illustration is fra
 med by ornamental motifs unique to its featured species\, incorporating e
 lements from its life cycle\, host plants\, and surrounding ecosystem.\n\
 nOriginally designed as table markers for the couple’s wedding reception\
 , the complete series extends beyond its ceremonial purpose as a celebrat
 ion of transformation\, growth\, and the interconnectedness of nature. Li
 ke marriage itself\, metamorphosis is a process of continual change. Refl
 ected throughout the lives of the insects depicted in these illustrations
 .\n\n
CATEGORIES:Bloomington,Free,Gallery,Music
