CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260915
DESCRIPTION:Learn simple pottery hand building techniques to form this cut
 e pumpkin shaped plate. It’s perfectly sized to hold a candle\, soap\, o
 r jewelry. You’ll work with clay to make the plate and underglaze to dec
 orate it. Plates will be ready for pick up the next week. Shipping availab
 le.\nJoin us for our Friday Workshops! Workshops run from Friday\, Septem
 ber 25 to December 11\, 6PM to 8PM. Make sure to select your workshop date
  and the 6:00 timeslot to be signed up. Your project price includes one be
 verage\; wine\, beer\, coffee\, espresso\, hot chocolate or tea (other sel
 ections are available) Ages 15+\nSeats limited. You must book ahead. Pleas
 e note that our workshops are non-refundable due to limited seating.\nYou 
 must be 21+ to consume alcohol.\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20260915
LOCATION:20 N Van Buren St\, Nashville\, IN 47448
ORGANIZER;CN="Our Little World":MAILTO:Shop@ourlittleworld.com
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
