UID:6v8tq6bp7h7vfp6akfkoigcnmo@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20261003T090000
SEQUENCE:0
CREATED:20260813T194048Z
DESCRIPTION:Participation is free.<br><a href="https://www.google.com/url?
 q=https://bloomington.in.gov/farmers-market/apple-tasting&amp\;sa=D&amp\;s
 ource=calendar&amp\;ust=1787079596889445&amp\;usg=AOvVaw0U-ndIC8-gom5RBFuT
 kBL5" target="_blank">Apple Tasting information</a><br>Celebrate the incre
 dible diversity of apples grown by local farmers\, including rare heirloom
  and specialty varieties you are unlikely to find in a grocery store. From
  sweet and honeyed to tart and complex\, discover an array of crisp\, juic
 y apples perfect for snacking\, baking\, cider making\, or sharing with fa
 mily and friends.<br><br>Each variety offers its own unique flavor profile
 \, texture\, and story—reflecting generations of local growing tradition
 s\, seasonal harvests\, and regional agriculture. Whether you are a longti
 me apple enthusiast or simply curious to try something new\, this tasting 
 experience is a delicious way to explore the richness of the fall harvest.
 <br><br>Taste. Discover. Enjoy.
LAST-MODIFIED:20260813T194048Z
