ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://browncounty.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/
 06/2-scaled.jpeg
CATEGORIES:Entertainment,Happening,Live Music
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260526
DESCRIPTION:Multiple Grammy® nominee Martina McBride  ( http://martinam
 cbride.com/ )has sold over 23 million albums to date\, which includes 20 T
 op 10 singles and six No. 1 hits.\nMartina McBride  ( http://martinamcbr
 ide.com/ )has earned more than 15 major music awards\, including four wins
  for Female Vocalist of the Year from the Country Music Association and wo
 n three Academy of Country Music for Top Female Vocalist. Martina has been
  awarded 14 Gold Records\, nine Platinum honors\, three Double Platinum Re
 cords\, and two Triple Platinum Awards. Martina was awarded the Covenant H
 ouse Beacon of Hope Award and Music Business Association’s prestigious 2
 015 Harry Chapin Memorial Humanitarian Award for her philanthropic efforts
  on behalf of domestic violence. In 2019 Martina received the Cliffie Sto
 ne Icon Award at the ACM Honors event for her impactful contributions to C
 ountry Music. Martina was honored during the 46th Annual Common Wealth A
 wards of Distinguished Service for her philanthropic work and contribution
 s to society. In 2021 Martina unveiled her first exhibit in the Country Mu
 sic Hall of Fame and Museum\, titled “The Power of Her Voice.”\nMartin
 a has released two cookbooks – the first\, Around the Table\, a full-col
 or illustrated collection of her favorite recipes\, hosting tips\, practic
 al menu planning advice\, and themed décor inspiration. She released her 
 second book\, Martina’s Kitchen Mix: My Recipe Playlist for Real Life\,
  in October 2018. Most recently Martina launched her own wine label\, Luna
  & Finn\, named after her beloved pets.\nWhen Martina isn’t in the studi
 o\, she focuses her time on charitable causes dear to her heart through he
 r Team Music Is Love charity imitative.\nMcBride resides in Nashville with
  her husband\, John\, and their three daughters. You can keep up with her 
 on Facebook ( http://tumblr.us12.list-manage1.com/track/click?u=12625cf90
 00644aef0f718377&id=1c27fb98dd&e=a1574695d1 )\, as well as Twitter ( http
 ://tumblr.us12.list-manage.com/track/click?u=12625cf9000644aef0f718377&id=
 5297e24a37&e=a1574695d1 ) and Instagram ( http://tumblr.us12.list-manage
 .com/track/click?u=12625cf9000644aef0f718377&id=cee3019f2d&e=a1574695d1 ).
  For tour dates\, please visit her website ( http://www.martinamcbride.co
 m/tour ).\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20260630
LOCATION:200 Maple Leaf Boulevard\, Nashville\, IN 47448
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://browncounty.com/events/martina-mcbride/
X-SOURCE:Brown County Events
END:VEVENT
