 important part of our work at the LGBTQ+ Culture Center. That's why we are
  proud to partner with Counseling &amp\; Psychological Services (CAPS) to 
 provide an embedded counselor in our space every Monday from 8:00 a.m. to 
 5:00 p.m.  </p><p><strong>Mollibeth Penner\, LHMCA</strong> serves as our 
