X-LIVEWHALE-IMAGE:https://events.iu.edu/live/image/gid/140/width/168/heigh
 t/168/crop/1/src_region/0\,0\,368\,367/31730_Book_Cover_Image.rev.17858476
 82.png
X-LIVEWHALE-IMAGE-CAPTION:Book cover
X-LIVEWHALE-SUMMARY:<p>EASC presents a book talk by Dr. Peng Xu on her new
  monograph <em>The Courtesan's Memory\, Voice\, and Late Ming Drama.</em><
 /p>
