DTEND:20261005T170000Z
DTSTAMP:20260923T152449Z
UID:20261005T160000Z-2428201@events.iu.edu
RECURRENCE-ID:20261005T160000Z
ATTACH:https://events.iu.edu/live/image/gid/92/width/168/height/168/crop/1
 /src_region/0,0,591,293/23048_Logos_LiveWhale.rev.1725461563.png
DESCRIPTION:IU's five Global Gateway (https://global.iu.edu/presence/gatew
 ays/index.html) offices – in Accra\, Bangkok\, Berlin\, Mexico City\, an
 d New Delhi – facilitate a range of academic activities that increase IU
 's international visibility and impact and assists different stakeholders 
 of the IU community across the different campuses in establishing connecti
 ons and collaborations with local partners.With the help of the IU Global 
 Gateways\, you can bring fresh perspectives\, opportunities\, and connecti
 ons back to Indiana\, enriching our students and strengthening our state. 
  Members of the Gateway network cordially invite you to attend one of the 
