DESCRIPTION:Join Chiefs in Intellectual Property (ChIPs) for a causal\, fu
 n wellness week event. We will gather in the law school lobby at 12pm and 
 then take a short walk over to Dunn Meadows for a picnic outside. ChIPs wi
 ll provide chips for the event\, but please plan to bring your own lunch a
 nd blanket/towel/chair to sit on!  We kindly request that participants avo
 id bringing peanuts due to potential airborne peanut allergies. If you are
  interested in attending and have an airborne allergy\, please let us know
  and we can update our information to include that food item.  RSVP by Oct
 ober 4th at noon.&#160\;
