CATEGORIES:Social Event
CATEGORIES:Campus-Wide Event
DESCRIPTION:Cureiosity is an interactive experience designed to explore th
 e fun side of making healthy choices for your mind\, body\, and overall w
 ell-being! Join us for an afternoon of movement\, creativity\, and connec
 tion as we discover simple ways to incorporate wellness into everyday lif
 e.\nDance it out with Just Dance\, build your own delicious snack board\,
  and unwind with DIY journal making while learning how small\, intentiona
 l choices can make a big difference in how we feel. Whether you’re lookin
 g to move\, create\, relax\, or simply try something new\, Cureiosity is 
 a space to explore what wellness looks like for you—no experience require
 d!\nCome curious\, leave inspired\, and take a few new ideas for caring f
 or yourself with you.\nSchedule for the Day:\nJust Dance: 11am-12:30pm\; 
 Prizes!\nLunch: 1:00pm-2:30pm\; Dietician sharing expert advice over heal
 thy snacks\nJournaling: 3pm-4:30pm\; Receive a free journal and earn some
  ways to make journaling a daily practice\nAll Indiana University events\
 , groups\, activities\, and educational\, cultural\, and historical obser
 vances welcome all IU students and other members of the Indiana Universit
 y community.\n\nHosted by: Indiana Memorial Union Board\n\nAdditional Inf
 ormation can be found at: https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12564284
DTEND:20261006T203000Z
DTSTAMP:20260926T045204Z
DTSTART:20261006T150000Z
LOCATION:Frangipani
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Union Board Mind and Body and STEM Presents: Cureiosity: A Day of 
 Wellness & Well-Being
