DESCRIPTION: \nJoin IUSG and RHA for an interactive Red Zone Awareness eve
 nt focused on building a safer campus community through education and eng
 agement. Participants will move through five self-paced stations covering
  Red Zone awareness\, consent education\, and bystander intervention\, wh
 ile enjoying activities\, giveaways\, prizes\, and free resources. Design
 ed to reinforce important concepts introduced during It's On Us training\
 , this event helps students recognize risk factors\, practice healthy rel
 ationship skills\, and learn how to support their peers.\n \n\nHosted by:
  Indiana University Student Government\, Residence Hall Association\n\nAd
 ditional Information can be found at: https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/even
 t/12819907
