X-SOURCE-URLS:{"IU beINvolved Student Orgs": "https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12594905", "IU La Casa Latino Cultural Center": "https://events.iu.edu/lacasaiub/event/2386306-latine-voices-engagement-representation-and"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Campuslabs Iub": "https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12594905"}
X-SOURCE-ID:campuslabs_iub
X-SOURCE:IU La Casa Latino Cultural Center, IU beINvolved Student Orgs
CATEGORIES:ThoughtfulLearning
DESCRIPTION:Join Dr. Vanessa Cruz Nichols (Department of Political Science
 ) for an engaging exploration of Latine political participation in the Un
 ited States. Drawing on her research and expertise\, Dr. Cruz Nichols wil
 l examine the many ways Latine communities engage in civic and political 
