CATEGORIES:Cultural
CATEGORIES:Performance
CATEGORIES:Social Event
CATEGORIES:Arts & Humanities
CATEGORIES:Cultural Wellness
CATEGORIES:Campus-Wide Event
DESCRIPTION:Immerse yourself in the vibrant traditions and rich diversity 
 of the Latine community at Culture Through the Senses. Whether you are lo
 oking to honor your roots or experience something new\, join us in the Al
 umni Hall & Solarium for an unforgettable journey through sound\, sight\,
  touch\, and taste:\n\n\nSight: Marvel at captivating dance performances 
 and browse an inspiring art showcase featuring talented local Latine arti
 sts.\n\n\nSound: Feel the rhythm of the culture with a curated backdrop o
 f traditional and modern music.\n\n\nTouch: Get hands-on and create your 
 own cultural keepsakes with fun interactive crafts.\n\n\nTaste: Treat you
 r palate to a live cooking demonstration by an IMU chef featuring iconic 
 flavors.\n\n\nBring your friends\, bring your appetite\, and bring your c
 uriosity to this campus-wide celebration.\nAll Indiana University events\
 , groups\, activities\, and educational\, cultural\, and historical obser
 vances welcome all IU students and other members of the Indiana Universit
 y community.\n\nHosted by: Indiana Memorial Union Board\, La Casa/Latino 
 Cultural Center\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https://beinvo
 lved.indiana.edu/event/12753299
DTEND:20261007T010000Z
DTSTAMP:20260926T045204Z
DTSTART:20261006T220000Z
LOCATION:Frangipani Room\, Indiana Memorial Union
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Union Board Global Connections Presents: Culture through the Senses
UID:https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12753299
URL:https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12753299
X-HOSTS:La Casa/Latino Cultural Center
END:VEVENT
