CATEGORIES:Cultural
DESCRIPTION:\nExplore the powerful movement\, rhythms\, and cultural tradi
 tions of Afro-Cuban dance through Orisha dances and/or Palo. This worksho
 p introduces participants to the embodied language\, rhythms\, gestures\,
  and storytelling connected to these rich Afro-Cuban traditions.\nNo prev
 ious experience is necessary! All levels are welcome. Come ready to move\
 , learn\, connect with the music\, and experience the spirit and energy o
 f Afro-Cuban dance.\n\nPhoto: Courtesy of the Hemisphere Institute \n\nHo
 sted by: Ritmos Latinos at IU-Bloomington\n\nAdditional Information can b
 e found at: https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12773654
