X-LIVEWHALE-SUMMARY:<p>\n  As part of the <a href="https://go.iu.edu/Ameri
 ca250" target="_blank" rel="noopener">America 250</a> initiative\, the Lil
 ly Library is proud to present an exhibition exploring the Declaration of 
 Independence.\n</p>
