DESCRIPTION:Learn more about this program and tips on building your resume
  to submit for this great opportunity.  Advancing Indiana leadership in cl
 imate action and sustainability  McKinney Climate Fellows (MCF) is a workf
 orce development program connecting undergraduate and graduate students in
 terested in climate\, sustainability\, and community resilience with caree
 r experiences. The program partners with Indiana-based private\, public\, 
 and nonprofit organizations to host student fellows and provide solutions-
 based sustainability expertise.  Climate fellows gain valuable experience 
 working full-time in a professional setting\; partners receive assistance 
 in sustainability and climate planning from talented students\; and Indian
 a benefits from this critical sustainability work.
GEO:39.168188;-86.523031
LAST-MODIFIED:20260831T193802Z
LOCATION:ERNIE PYLE HALL
URL:https://events.iu.edu/live/events/2392434-mckinney-climate-fellows-res
 ume-workshop
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Learn more about this program and tips o
 n building your resume to submit for this great opportunity.</p><p>  Advan
 cing Indiana leadership in climate action and sustainability</p><p>  McKin
 ney Climate Fellows (MCF) is a workforce development program connecting un
 dergraduate and graduate students interested in climate\, sustainability\,
  and community resilience with career experiences. The program partners wi
 th Indiana-based private\, public\, and nonprofit organizations to host st
 udent fellows and provide solutions-based sustainability expertise.<br /><
 br />  Climate fellows gain valuable experience working full-time in a pro
 fessional setting\; partners receive assistance in sustainability and clim
 ate planning from talented students\; and Indiana benefits from this criti
 cal sustainability work.</p>
X-LIVEWHALE-CONTACT-INFO:<p>\n  Elizabeth Bolyard<br />\n  <a href="mailto
 :eboyard@iu.edu">ebolyard@iu.edu</a>\n</p>
