SUMMARY:Future Tense 2026: Exhibition
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261009
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261010
DTSTAMP:20260818T161743Z
UID:20261009T040000Z-2385181@events.iu.edu
RECURRENCE-ID;VALUE=DATE:20261009
ATTACH:https://events.iu.edu/live/image/gid/11/width/168/height/168/crop/1
 /src_region/0,0,768,576/32052_coyne-katherine-body-knot.rev.1787083712.jpg
CATEGORIES:Art and museum exhibitions
DESCRIPTION:Since 2017\, Surface Design Association (SDA) has invited stud
 ents to submit work for the annual Juried Student Exhibition.Opening recep
 tion: Friday\, September 4\, 6–8 pm\, Grunwald GalleryJuror's Remarks an
 d Awards: Friday\, September 4\, 6:30 pm\, Grunwald GalleryThe Grunwald Ga
 llery of Art at Indiana University Bloomington partners with Surface Desig
 n Association to present "Future Tense 2026"—a national student exhibiti
 on juried by José Santiago Pérez.Since 2017\, Surface Design Association
  (SDA) has invited students to submit work for the annual Juried Student E
 xhibition. The ninth iteration of this exhibition will be held at Indiana 
 University's Grunwald Gallery of Art in Bloomington\, IN from August 25-Oc
 tober 31\, 2026. Exhibiting artists are eligible for four awards recognizi
 ng excellence in artistic practice."Future Tense"celebrates the creative w
 ork of student artists\, designers\, and makers working with\, or inspired
  by fiber\, or textile materials\, or techniques. This exhibition offers a
  glimpse into the future of contemporary fibers by presenting the very bes
 t work being made by students in the field today.Exhibiting Artists:Audrey
  Allanson  Prisma Andrade  River Berry  Hephzibah Brown  Zoe Chavez  MJ Co
 ok  Katherine Coyne  Kimber Gada  Laura Ion  Audrey Jeanes  Savannah Jubic
   Bug Karplus  Drew Kibler  Oliver Krueger  Ashley Lian  Haven Overton  No
 a Rickey  Eden Scroggins  Allison Walter  Lola Webb  Freda Xinyue Xia
GEO:39.169084;-86.518997
LAST-MODIFIED:20260818T201743Z
LOCATION:Fine Arts Building\, 1201 East 7th Street\, Bloomington\, IN 4740
 5
URL:https://events.iu.edu/soaadiub/event/2385181-future-tense-2026-exhibit
 ion
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Since 2017\, Surface Design Association 
 (SDA) has invited students to submit work for the annual Juried Student Ex
 hibition.</p><p><span data-contrast="none"><strong>Opening reception:</str
 ong> Friday\, September 4\, 6–8 pm\, Grunwald Gallery<br /></span><span 
 data-contrast="none"><strong>Juror's Remarks and Awards:</strong> Friday\,
  September 4\, 6:30 pm\, Grunwald Gallery</span></p><p><span data-contrast
 ="none">The Grunwald Gallery of Art at Indiana University Bloomington part
 ners with Surface Design Association to present "</span>Future Tense 2026"
 —<span data-contrast="none">a national student exhibition juried by Jos
 é Santiago Pérez.</span><span data-contrast="auto">Since 2017\, Surface 
 Design Association (SDA) has invited students to submit work for the annua
 l Juried Student Exhibition. The ninth iteration of this exhibition will b
 e held at Indiana University's Grunwald Gallery of Art in Bloomington\, IN
  from August 25-October 31\, 2026. Exhibiting artists are eligible for fou
 r awards recognizing excellence in artistic practice.</span><span data-ccp
 -props="{}"></span></p><p><span data-contrast="none">"Future Tense"</span>
 <span data-contrast="auto">celebrates the creative work of student artists
 \, designers\, and makers working with\, or inspired by fiber\, or textile
  materials\, or techniques. This exhibition offers a glimpse into the futu
 re of contemporary fibers by presenting the very best work being made by s
 tudents in the field today.</span><span data-ccp-props="{}"></span></p><p 
 class="p1"><strong>Exhibiting Artists:<br /></strong>Audrey Allanson<br />
   Prisma Andrade<br />  River Berry<br />  Hephzibah Brown<br />  Zoe Chav
 ez<br />  MJ Cook<br />  Katherine Coyne<br />  Kimber Gada<br />  Laura I
 on<br />  Audrey Jeanes<br />  Savannah Jubic<br />  Bug Karplus<br />  Dr
 ew Kibler<br />  Oliver Krueger<br />  Ashley Lian<br />  Haven Overton<br
  />  Noa Rickey<br />  Eden Scroggins<br />  Allison Walter<br />  Lola We
 bb<br />  Freda Xinyue Xia</p>
