BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Brown County State Park": "on.in.gov/browncountysp"}
X-SOURCE-ID:localist_brown_county_sp
SUMMARY:Stargazing\, Brown County State Park
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261009T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261009T220000
UID:c16ea23040631b3ebf70da31ab1305b9@events.in.gov
DESCRIPTION:Join a park naturalist for an evening of stargazing! We will h
 ave our telescope at Hoen Point from 8pm to 10pm. There are several potent
 ial targets to see with the telescope\, in addition to fall constellations
 . Please be considerate of the naturalist and other visitors by minimizing
  the use of flashlights and car headlights. Red tipped flashlights are bes
 t for preserving night vision\, and using parking/fog lights if you arrive
  late or leave early is also polite! Please note that Hoen Point does not 
 have a restroom. Plan accordingly! Also please note the current version of
  the park map has a mistake. CCC Point is labeled as Hohen Point. Hohen Po
 int is the vista to the south east of CCC Point. Be aware the event may en
 d early depending on weather.
LOCATION:Brown County State Park\, Hoen Point\, 1405 S.R. 46 W\, Nashville
 \, IN 
URL:on.in.gov/browncountysp
X-SOURCE:Brown County State Park
END:VEVENT
