DESCRIPTION:GDC is a multidisciplinary\, student-led consulting program wh
 ere IU students from across majors and class years work in teams on real-w
 orld international development projects. Consultants collaborate with glob
 al partner organizations\, tackle complex challenges\, and gain hands-on e
 xperience that goes far beyond the classroom.Through GDC\, you can:Work on
  real international development projects  Collaborate with organizations a
 nd partners around the world  Build consulting\, research\, project manage
 ment\, and communication skills  Learn about global challenges across regi
 ons and sectors  Join a multidisciplinary community of students from acros
 s IU  Grow into leadership roles over multiple years in the Lab  No prior 
 consulting or international development experience is required. If you're 
 curious about global issues and want to put your skills to work on meaning
 ful projects\, come learn what GDC is all about.  **must be able to attend
  weekly meetings on Fridays from 1:55-3:55  Ready to apply? Click here (ht
 tps://forms.gle/8RUQUNADfZG6QjR16)
