 ing-applications-due
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  GDC is a multidisciplinary\, student-led
  consulting program where IU students from across majors and class years w
 ork in teams on real-world international development projects. Consultants
  collaborate with global partner organizations\, tackle complex challenges
 \, and gain hands-on experience that goes far beyond the classroom.</p><p>
 <strong>Through GDC\, you can:</strong></p><ul><li>Work on real internatio
 nal development projects  </li><li>Collaborate with organizations and part
 ners around the world  </li><li>Build consulting\, research\, project mana
 gement\, and communication skills  </li><li>Learn about global challenges 
 across regions and sectors  </li><li>Join a multidisciplinary community of
  students from across IU  </li><li>Grow into leadership roles over multipl
 e years in the Lab  </li></ul><p><strong>No prior consulting or internatio
 nal development experience is required.</strong> If you're curious about g
 lobal issues and want to put your skills to work on meaningful projects\, 
 come learn what GDC is all about.</p><p>  **must be able to attend weekly 
 meetings on Fridays from 1:55-3:55</p><p>  Ready to apply? <a href="https:
 //forms.gle/8RUQUNADfZG6QjR16">Click here</a></p>
