DESCRIPTION:Stop by the Bloomington Community Farmers' Market to learn abo
 ut electric transportation. The newly reformed Hoosier Electric Vehicle As
 sociation will host a booth with friendly\, straightforward information ab
 out electric vehicles\, hybrids\, electric bikes\, and the practical benef
 its of more efficient and sustainable transportation.\n\nWhether you're dr
 iving electric already\, considering your next vehicle\, or just curious h
 ow EVs fit into everyday life in Bloomington\, come ask questions and join
  the conversation. If an electric bike is on hand\, it will be a good look
  at another side of local electric mobility.\n\nPart of National Drive Ele
 ctric Month. A Fair of the Arts is also happening at the market this day.\
 n\nMore info: https://driveelectricmonth.org/event?eventid=5381
LAST-MODIFIED:20260911T174012Z
LOCATION:Showers Commons at City Hall\, 401 N Morton Street\, Bloomington\
 , IN 47404
