DESCRIPTION:Join us for a guided tour at the Eskenazi Museum of Art as par
 t of Memory Transformed: Materials of Heritage in Jewish Eastern European 
 Life.  The tour complements the day's symposium\, museum reception\, and e
 vening concert by bringing participants into the museum for an opportunity
  to engage with art and material culture in connection with the broader th
 emes of memory\, cultural heritage\, and artistic interpretation explored 
 throughout Memory Transformed.Advance registration is required for the gui
 ded tour\, and space is limited.  A second guided tour will be offered at 
 5:00 p.m. Guests should register for only one tour time.  The museum recep
 tion is open to all and does not require participation in a tour.
