 ="none">The Grunwald Gallery of Art at Indiana University Bloomington part
 ners with Surface Design Association to present "</span>Future Tense 2026"
 —<span data-contrast="none">a national student exhibition juried by Jos
 é Santiago Pérez.</span><span data-contrast="auto">Since 2017\, Surface 
 Design Association (SDA) has invited students to submit work for the annua
