 ersity's First Artist in Residence</em></strong></p><p><em>Capturing the C
 ampus</em> pays tribute to renowned Hoosier artist T.C. Steele. The exhibi
 t honors the century that has passed since his death by showcasing paintin
 gs form the artist's residency at IU and other relevant works. The exhibit
  will bring together Steele's landscapes from the IU Public Art and Cultur
 al Heritage Collection and the Indiana State Museum and Historic Sites' co
 llection\, allowing the holdings of these two collections to be viewed in 
 one space.        </p><p style="text-align: center\;"><strong>Dates: April
  17\, 2026 - April 2026</strong></p><p><picture class="lw_image lw_image30
 589  lw_align_left"><source media="(max-width: 500px)" type="image/webp" s
