LAST-MODIFIED:20260810T184650Z
LOCATION:GLOBAL &amp\; INTERNATIONAL STUDIES BUILDING
URL:https://events.iu.edu/hls/event/2356658-global-competencies-series-stu
 dent-career-dinner
