DESCRIPTION:<p>The Board of Park Commissioners is a policy-making authorit
 y for the City of Bloomington Parks and Recreation Department. The Board i
 s comprised of four members appointed by the Mayor.</p><p>Statutory Author
 ity: <a href="http://www.in.gov/legislative/ic/code/title36/ar10/ch4.html
 "><u>(I.C. 36-10-4) (BMC 2.20)</u></a></p><p>The Board meets at Bloomingto
 n's City Hall at 5 p.m. on the third Thursday of the month\, with some exc
 eptions for holidays.</p><p>See meeting agendas and notes from the Board o
 f Park Commissioners online at <a href="https://bloomington.in.gov/boards
 /park-commissioners">https://bloomington.in.gov/boards/park-commissioners<
 /a></p><p>For more information about the Board of Park Commissioners\, <a
  href="mailto:parks@bloomington.in.gov"><u>send an email to Parks and Recr
 eation Department Director Tim Street</u></a> or call<a><u> 812-349-3700
 </u></a>.</p>
