 na.edu/</a><br />\n  <br />\n  <a href="https://jpsi.indiana.edu/contact-r
 esources/index.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Event announcement lis
 tserv</a>\n</p>
X-LIVEWHALE-COST:Free
X-LIVEWHALE-ID:2428192
X-LIVEWHALE-SUMMARY:<p>\n  A public talk/Q&amp\;A about <span data-olk-cop
 y-source="MessageBody">Beijing's restrictions on rare earths and energy an
 d how the US\, Japan and other partners are responding.</span> <strong>ROO
 M TBD</strong>\n</p>
