SUMMARY:Story: Sajik Kim exhibition
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261016
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261017
DTSTAMP:20260818T163935Z
UID:20261016T040000Z-2385188@events.iu.edu
