DESCRIPTION:Have you been wanting to learn how to crochet? Learn to croche
 t granny squares. No experience required. You’ll learn basic stitches to
  create a simple granny square that can be used to make so many projects. 
 Come back or join us virtually the next week for our Granny Square Pumpkin
  Workshop.\nJoin us for our Friday Workshops! Workshops run from Friday\,
  September 25 to December 11\, 6PM to 8PM. Make sure to select your worksh
 op date and the 6:00 timeslot to be signed up. Your project price includes
  one beverage\; wine\, beer\, coffee\, espresso\, hot chocolate or tea (ot
 her selections are available) Ages 15+\nSeats limited. You must book ahead
 . Please note that our workshops are non-refundable due to limited seating
 .\nYou must be 21+ to consume alcohol.\n
