SUMMARY:Wine Your Way Through 2026
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261017T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261018T010000
DTSTAMP:20260917T121848Z
UID:MEC-9dcd1a2cce68eb84477aaf9179646bb3@browncounty.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261017T170000
SEQUENCE:1
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/webp:https://browncounty.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/
 09/image-1-1.webp
CATEGORIES:Fall,Festivals,Plan Your Visit
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260917
DESCRIPTION:\nJoin us at Range 46 Wine Co. for a day of wine\, live music\
 , food and fall fun!\nWine your way through our five-acre corn maze as you
  search for six tasting stations\, enjoying unlimited samples at each stop
  along the way. After completing the maze\, stick around for live music\, 
 food trucks\, fire pits\, Range 46 wines and beer from Hog Molly Brewing C
 o.\nCorn Maze Tastings: 1–6 p.m.\nA ticket is required to participate. T
 he corn maze is open only to guests ages 21 and older during the event.\nA
 fter-Party: 6–9 p.m.\nNo ticket is required.\nImportant Information:\n\n
 You must be 21 or older to purchase a ticket and enter the corn maze.\nAtt
 endees must carry two forms of identification at all times\, such as a pho
 to ID and credit card.\nYour photo ID and ticket will be checked before en
 tering the maze.\nThe property grounds are family-friendly.\nWell-behaved 
 pets are welcome but must remain leashed at all times. Owners are responsi
 ble for cleaning up after their pets.\nTickets are nonrefundable under all
  circumstances.\n\n\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20260917
ORGANIZER;CN="Range 46 Wine Co.":MAILTO:range46wine@gmail.com
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://www.eventbrite.com/e/wine-your-way-through-2026-tickets-199646
 6673564
X-SOURCE:Brown County Events
END:VEVENT
