 873833 BCX8">Indianapolis</span></span><span class="TextRun SCXW9873833 BC
 X8" lang="EN-US" xml:lang="EN-US" data-contrast="auto"><span class="Normal
 TextRun SCXW9873833 BCX8">. Drawing on memories and influences spanning Ti
 bbetts' life\, the exhibition traces what he describes as a path away from
  "the commonplace and the ordinary" and toward the wonderful\, extraordina
 ry\, and terrifying. The exhibition will remain on view throughout October
 .</span></span></p><p><span class="TextRun SCXW9873833 BCX8" lang="EN-US" 
 xml:lang="EN-US" data-contrast="auto"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW98738
 33 BCX8">Presented as part of Festival451indy.</span></span></p><p><span c
 lass="TextRun SCXW9873833 BCX8" lang="EN-US" xml:lang="EN-US" data-contras
 t="auto"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW9873833 BCX8">Festival 451indy is 
 sponsored in part by Herbert Simon Family Foundation with additional suppo
 rt from Indiana Humanities</span></span></p>
