DESCRIPTION:"ExcursionsIntothe Weird\," is an exhibition of paintings by a
 rtist\, author\, and longtime Bradbury friend John CarterTibbetts\, openin
 g October 1 at the Cultural Arts Galleryat IUIndianapolis. Drawing on memo
 ries and influences spanning Tibbetts' life\, the exhibition traces what h
 e describes as a path away from "the commonplace and the ordinary" and tow
 ard the wonderful\, extraordinary\, and terrifying. The exhibition will re
 main on view throughout October.Presented as part of Festival451indy.Festi
 val 451indy is sponsored in part by Herbert Simon Family Foundation with a
 dditional support from Indiana Humanities
