CATEGORIES:Academic/Career
DESCRIPTION:\n\nTHE BUSINESS COLLECTIVEBuild Your Network. Explore Your Op
 tions. Prepare for What's Next.\nDesigned specifically for pre-business s
 tudents\, the Business Collective connects students with upperclassmen\, 
 IU alumni\, employers\, and career coaches who can help them navigate the
  pre-business experience and explore what's possible beyond it.\nEach vir
 tual session offers a different perspective\, giving students access to p
 eople who can share candid advice\, expand their understanding of career 
 possibilities\, and help them prepare for future opportunities.\nBUILD YO
 UR NETWORK: October 20th\, 3:30-4:30pm\n \nThe Real Pre-Business Playbook
  Real talk from students who've been there.\n \nConnect with upperclassme
 n who have successfully navigated the pre-business experience and get can
 did answers to the questions first-year students actually want to ask.\n 
 \nStudents will:\nHear what upperclassmen wish they had known during thei
 r first year.\nGet honest perspectives on academics\, involvement\, exper
 ience\, and finding community.\nLearn strategies for making the most of t
 he pre-business experience.\nBuild connections with students who have alr
 eady navigated the journey.Attend all three sessions to earn a Business C
 ollective certificate.\n\nHosted by: Undergraduate Education\n\nAdditiona
 l Information can be found at: https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12759
 811
DTEND:20261020T203000Z
DTSTAMP:20260926T045204Z
