 ncluding the <em>The Departed</em><em>\, Extremely Loud and Incredibly Cl
 ose\, Hitch</em>\, <em>Julie and Julia</em><em>\, The Manchurian Candidat
 e</em>\, and <em>Moonrise Kingdom</em>. He has collaborated on albums and
  live concerts with such artists as The Who\, Sting\, Peter Gabriel\, and
