 da. He has collaborated with pianists Leif Ove Andsnes\, Emmanuel Ax\, Jo
 rge Bolet\, Yefim Bronfman\, Radu Lupu\, Wolfgang Sawallisch\, Andras Sch
 iff\, and Jean-Yves Thibaudet\, and with the Emerson and Guarneri String 
