 , looking for ways to support a friend\, or simply want to enjoy a great 
 cup of coffee\, everyone is welcome.\nEach Recovery Brews Pop-Up features
  a unique theme designed to spark conversation\, build community\, and hi
 ghlight different aspects of recovery and well-being.\n\nHosted by: Colle
 giate Recovery Community\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https
 ://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12544093
