 k-copy-source="MailCompose">Katherine A. Ntiamoah</strong>\n</h5>\n<div>\n
   <div>\n    <strong data-olk-copy-source="MailCompose">kntiamoa at iu dot
  edu</strong>\n  </div>\n  <div>\n    Director of Policy Engagement and St
 rategic Partnerships\n  </div>\n  <div>\n    Hamilton Lugar School of Glob
 al &amp\; International Studies\n  </div>\n</div>
