X-LIVEWHALE-IMAGE:https://events.iu.edu/live/image/gid/234/width/168/heigh
 t/168/crop/1/src_region/0\,0\,644\,800/32022_RS23041_2025.100_view_1_dig_2
 .rev.1786983304.jpg
X-LIVEWHALE-IMAGE-CAPTION:<span data-teams="true">Abelardo Morell (America
 n\, b. Cuba\, b. 1948). <strong>Camera Obscura: The Eiffel Tower in the Ho
 tel Frantour</strong>\, 1999. Gelatin silver print\, 24 × 20 in. (61  50.
