X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Events Livewhale 135": "https://events.iu.edu/hls/event/2418599-fall-graduate-student-research-symposium"}
X-SOURCE-ID:events_livewhale_135
SUMMARY:Fall Graduate Student Research Symposium
DTSTART:20261022T220000Z
DTEND:20261023T000000Z
DTSTAMP:20260915T105712Z
UID:20261022T220000Z-2418599@events.iu.edu
RECURRENCE-ID:20261022T220000Z
ATTACH:https://events.iu.edu/live/image/gid/135/width/168/height/168/crop/
 1/src_region/0,0,1102,1427/32513_Grad_student_symposium_poster_v3.rev.1789
 484009.png
CATEGORIES:Lectures, talks, seminars, and conferences,Student-run
DESCRIPTION:The HLS Graduate Peer Mentors invite you to participate in our
  Fall Graduate Student Research Symposium on Thursday\, October 22\, from 
 6:00–8:00 PM in GA 3067.    The symposium is an informal and supportive 
 opportunity to share your research with fellow graduate students\, receive
  feedback\, and learn more about the wide range of research being conducte
 d across HLS. Research at any stage is welcome: you do not need to have a 
 completed paper or project to participate.      We are currently looking f
 or graduate student presenters. If you would like to present\, please emai
 l arumiant@iu.edu (mailto:arumiant@iu.edu) with a tentative presentation t
 itle and a short description of your project by Thursday\, October 8.     
