CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260915
DESCRIPTION:Learn to piece together granny squares to create a pumpkin! No
  experience required. This workshop will be live and virtual! Bring your o
 wn granny squares or use ours. (If you want to learn to make Granny Square
 s\, join us the week before!) Virtual attendees will need their own granny
  squares and assembly yarn. Virtual participants will be sent a link to me
 et via Zoom after completing checkout and separate of the order confirmati
 on.\nJoin us for our Friday Workshops! Workshops run from Friday\, Septem
 ber 25 to December 11\, 6PM to 8PM. Make sure to select your workshop date
  and the 6:00 timeslot to be signed up. Your project price includes one be
 verage\; wine\, beer\, coffee\, espresso\, hot chocolate or tea (other sel
 ections are available) Ages 15+\nSeats limited. You must book ahead. Pleas
 e note that our workshops are non-refundable due to limited seating.\nYou 
 must be 21+ to consume alcohol.\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20260915
