DTSTART:20261023T230000Z
DTEND:20261024T000000Z
LOCATION:AUDITORIUM
GEO:39.168443;-86.517858
SUMMARY:Zach Williams' Revival Nights Tour
DESCRIPTION:Get ready to experience a revival! Presented by Awakening Eve
 nts\, Zach Williams' Revival Nights Tour has an energy this fall that's a
  little gritty\, a lot louder\, and always real. This is more than just a
  concert—it's a night of revival and renewal.  &#160\;  Zach Williams h
 as the power behind "Chain Breaker" and "Rescue Story" while Cochren &amp
 \; Co. make waves with their favorites like "Church (Take Me Back)" and "
 Running Home." Singer/Songwriter Christian Hohn opens the night with new 
 music that tells his story of faith in way that suits this tour's theme o
 f everyday life\, struggle\, and redemption.  &#160\;  Come as you are an
 d experience the transforming power of music\, worship and community. A l
 imited number of Revival Nights VIP tickets offer best seating\, early me
 rch shopping\, and a Meet &amp\; Greet with photo opportunity with Zach W
 illiams. Grab your seats before they're gone!
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Get ready to experience a revival! Pres
 ented by Awakening Events\, Zach Williams' Revival Nights Tour has an ene
 rgy this fall that's a little gritty\, a lot louder\, and always real. Th
 is is more than just a concert—it's a night of revival and renewal.</p>
 <p>  &#160\;</p><p>  Zach Williams has the power behind "Chain Breaker" a
 nd "Rescue Story" while Cochren &amp\; Co. make waves with their favorite
 s like "Church (Take Me Back)" and "Running Home." Singer/Songwriter Chri
 stian Hohn opens the night with new music that tells his story of faith i
 n way that suits this tour's theme of everyday life\, struggle\, and rede
 mption.</p><p>  &#160\;</p><p>  Come as you are and experience the transf
 orming power of music\, worship and community. A limited number of Reviva
 l Nights VIP tickets offer best seating\, early merch shopping\, and a Me
 et &amp\; Greet with photo opportunity with Zach Williams. Grab your seat
 s before they're gone!</p>
