BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Limestone Post": "https://iu.co1.qualtrics.com/jfe/form/SV_1SWiO68SqxT0rH0"}
X-SOURCE-ID:limestone_post
SUMMARY:Free Head and Neck Cancer Screening
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261024T080000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261024T100000
UID:260922MdsQ82-Lp0uaECqbyEQSmw
DESCRIPTION:Join IU Health and the Head and Neck Cancer Alliance on Saturd
 ay\, October 24 at the YMCA of Morgan County for a free head and neck canc
 er screening. IU Health urges our community members to participate in our 
 free head and neck screening.\n\nIndividuals will receive a thorough exam 
 and learn the symptoms of head and neck cancer\, which include a lump or a
  sore that does not heal\, a sore throat that does not go away\, difficult
 y in swallowing\, and a change or hoarseness in the voice. For our communi
 ty members who are tobacco/alcohol users or who have exposure to human pap
 illomavirus \\(HPV\\)\, we strongly urge each individual to get screened a
 s both are strong risk factors for head and neck cancer.\n\nIn 2025\, it i
 s estimated that there will be more than 650\,000 new cases of head and ne
 ck cancer diagnosed worldwide. Unfortunately\, many individuals will not b
 e aware of their cancer until it has reached an advanced stage. Head and n
 eck cancer is now ranked in the top six cancers worldwide.\n\nPlease regis
 ter at: https://iu.co1.qualtrics.com/jfe/form/SV\\_1SWiO68SqxT0rH0\n\nWalk
 -ins will be welcome\n\nDetails:\n\nOctober 24th 8-10 AM \\(additional tim
 es may become available\\)\n\nYMCA of Morgan County - 2039 E Morgan Street
 \, Martinsville\, IN 46151\n\nFREE for all members of community
LOCATION:YMCA of Morgan County
URL:https://iu.co1.qualtrics.com/jfe/form/SV_1SWiO68SqxT0rH0
X-SOURCE:Limestone Post
END:VEVENT
