 ssemblages made with found printed and bound matter\, contemporary photogr
 aphy\, and selections of contemporary art of a variety of media in the col
 lections galleries.&#160\;  The tour may differ a little each time as what
 's on view changes. To request this tour for another date for a group visi
 t for 6-24 people: Request a Group Tour - Eskenazi Museum of Art (https://
 iubmuseum-fireform.eas.iu.edu/online/form/index/grouptour).Know Before You
  GoRSVPs are limited to 12 participants. Register below to reserve your sp
 ot. Walk-ins are welcome if space is available.If you have a reservation\,
  arrive early. Check in at least 5 minutes before your tour. At 1:55 p.m.\
 , any unclaimed spaces may be released to guests who are standing by waiti
 ng for a space.Admission and tours are free.If you prefer to save time at 
 the lockers\, avoid bringing backpacks or large bags.Read aboutwhere to fi
 nd us\, where to park\, accessibility\, and museum guidelines.When You Arr
 iveCheck in with Guest Services staff on the first floor.Store backpacks a
 nd large bags. Lockers and coat racks are available.Keep space (18") betwe
 en yourself\, including anything you're carrying\, and the art.If you park
 ed in the IMU parking lot\, Guest Services can validate your parking vouch
 er for a discount.
