X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Events Livewhale 64": "https://events.iu.edu/lawiub/event/2421297-so-who-gets-grandmas-house-and-other-horror"}
X-SOURCE-ID:events_livewhale_64
SUMMARY:So… Who Gets Grandma's House? And Other Horror Stories: Estate P
 lanning in Practice
DTSTART:20261026T160000Z
DTEND:20261026T170000Z
DTSTAMP:20260917T130400Z
UID:20261026T160000Z-2421297@events.iu.edu
RECURRENCE-ID:20261026T160000Z
CATEGORIES:Student-run
DESCRIPTION:Join the Real Estate and Estate Planning Association (REEPA) f
 or an engaging introduction to estate planning with attorneys E. Paige Fre
 itag and Erin M. Martoglio from Freitag &amp\; Martoglio. We'll explore th
 e basics of wills\, trusts\, probate\, powers of attorney\, and more\, whi
 le discussing what estate planning really looks like in practice.  Along t
 he way\, we'll share real-world challenges\, unexpected complications\, an
 d a few "horror stories" from practice that illustrate what can happen whe
 n estate plans don't go as expected.  Whether you're new to estate plannin
 g or simply curious about where law\, family\, money\, and death intersect
 \, this is a chance to see the fascinating\, sometimes dramatic\, and surp
 risingly juicy world of estate planning firsthand. Lunch will be provided!
GEO:39.165074;-86.526424
LAST-MODIFIED:20260917T171232Z
LOCATION:Lowell E. Baier Hall - Lecture Room - 125
URL:https://events.iu.edu/lawiub/event/2421297-so-who-gets-grandmas-house-
 and-other-horror
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Join the Real Estate and Estate Planning
  Association (REEPA) for an engaging introduction to estate planning with 
 attorneys E. Paige Freitag and Erin M. Martoglio from Freitag &amp\; Marto
 glio. We'll explore the basics of wills\, trusts\, probate\, powers of att
 orney\, and more\, while discussing what estate planning really looks like
  in practice.<br /><br />  Along the way\, we'll share real-world challeng
 es\, unexpected complications\, and a few "horror stories" from practice t
 hat illustrate what can happen when estate plans don't go as expected.<br 
 /><br />  Whether you're new to estate planning or simply curious about wh
 ere law\, family\, money\, and death intersect\, this is a chance to see t
 he fascinating\, sometimes dramatic\, and surprisingly juicy world of esta
 te planning firsthand. Lunch will be provided!</p>
X-LIVEWHALE-CONTACT-INFO:<p>\n  Elly Slevin<br />\n  Real Estate &amp\; Es
 tate Planning Association\n</p>
X-LIVEWHALE-ID:2421297
X-LIVEWHALE-TAGS:Real Estate and Estate Planning Association
X-LIVEWHALE-TIMEZONE:America/New_York
X-LIVEWHALE-TYPE:events
X-SOURCE:IU Maurer School of Law
END:VEVENT
