BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Brown County State Park": "https://on.in.gov/browncountysp"}
X-SOURCE-ID:localist_brown_county_sp
SUMMARY:Fall Color Hike: Discovery Trail\, Brown County State Park
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261029T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261029T154500
UID:8ce126f5f8fdf2b9088fcb36c07daa81@events.in.gov
DESCRIPTION:Join a park naturalist for a guided hike of the Discovery Trai
 l. This is a general hike about a variety of Brown County State Park topic
 s. Learn about Brown County&#39\;s fall colors\, flora\, fauna\, pioneer h
 istory\, and the interesting geology of Brown County State Park. The Disco
 very Trail is about half a mile long and considered moderate. There are mu
 ddy spots\, uneven surfaces\, tree roots\, and mild slopes. The trail will
  take us about 40 minutes to complete.
LOCATION:Brown County State Park\, Nature Center\, 1405 S.R. 46 W\, Nashvi
 lle\, IN 
URL:https://on.in.gov/browncountysp
X-SOURCE:Brown County State Park
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Brown County State Park": "https://on.in.gov/BrownCountySP"}
X-SOURCE-ID:localist_brown_county_sp
SUMMARY:Turtle Time\, Brown County State Park
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261029T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261029T154500
UID:4e5ddf5eaa6523f7388f554936e7c7c1@events.in.gov
DESCRIPTION:Come see an eastern box turtle as we feed it! Learn about the 
 unique adaptations these creatures have\, what issues they face\, and how 
 you can help their wild populations! If the weather is nice\, we will be o
 n the lawn outside the Nature Center. Otherwise\, we will be inside.
LOCATION:Brown County State Park\, Nature Center\, 1405 S.R. 46 W\, Nashvi
 lle\, IN 
URL:https://on.in.gov/BrownCountySP
X-SOURCE:Brown County State Park
END:VEVENT
