 ter by making art or journaling\, and make some time to check in with your
 self!</p><p>  Join us for a therapist-selected art activity meant to help 
 you feel more balanced and in control. No prior skills needed\, just bring
  your heart and mind.</p><p>  This group meets Thursday from 2–3 p.m.\, 
 excluding holidays and museum closures. Meetings are held in the Atrium of
  the <span class="hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-point
 er align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">Sidney and Lois Eskenaz
 i Museum of Art</span></span>. Food and beverages are permitted in the atr
 ium\, so participants are welcome to bring lunch.</p>
