CATEGORIES:Student-run
DESCRIPTION:Join the HLS Graduate Peer Mentors for a hands-on Academic Pos
 ter Workshop designed to help you develop\, revise\, and strengthen your r
 esearch poster.  Bring your poster draft\, work in progress\, or research 
 materials and use this session to work on your poster and receive feedback
 . The workshop is an opportunity to put the principles introduced during t
 he October 8 "How to Build Academic Posters" session into practice\, but a
 ttendance at the earlier workshop is not required.  This workshop will als
 o help students prepare for the Graduate Student Poster Session at the GAP
  Symposium at HLS on November 7. Whether you have a complete draft or are 
 still developing your poster\, you are welcome to participate.
LAST-MODIFIED:20260915T154228Z
LOCATION:GISB
URL:https://events.iu.edu/hls/event/2418615-academic-poster-workshop
