DESCRIPTION:Join us at the ACC for an evening discussing culture\, languag
 e and AI through various lenses. Snigdha Khanna is an IU doctoral researc
 her in Cognitive Science and Computational Linguistics. We meet and eat a
 nd share thoughts and questions on widespread use of Generative AI\, how 
 it must be reshaping human culture\, experiences\, and expressions. Throu
 gh a conversational format\, we gather to build community through the mas
 sive cultural shift we are living through.\n \nAll Indiana University eve
 nts\, groups\, activities\, and educational\, cultural\, and historical o
 bservances welcome all IU students and other members of the Indiana Unive
 rsity community.\n\nHosted by: Asian Culture Center\n\nAdditional Informa
 tion can be found at: https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12772455
DTEND:20261029T220000Z
DTSTAMP:20260926T045204Z
DTSTART:20261029T210000Z
