 ouse.\n\nInspired by the stories\, music\, and community spirit behind Bro
 wn County’s legendary Liar’s Bench\, these events bring together songw
 riters and listeners for afternoons of tall-tales\, original music\, coffe
 e and community.\n\nPull up a chair. Listen awhile.\n\nDates: Every last F
 riday of the monthTime: 4-6pm (staying open an hour later for these events
 )\n\n
