 1
X-LIVEWHALE-RSVP:1
X-LIVEWHALE-SUMMARY:<p>\n  War-zone crises\, U.S. cyber strategy\, and hig
 h-stakes tradecraft with 30-year diplomat Ambassador Gina Abercrombie-Wins
 tanley. Free dinner &amp\; direct access. Open to all!\n</p>
