 y">Katherine A. Ntiamoah</strong>\n</div>\n<div>\n  Director of Policy Eng
 agement and Strategic Partnerships\n</div>\n<div>\n  Hamilton Lugar School
  of Global &amp\; International Studies<br />\n  kntiamoa at iu dot edu\n<
 /div>
