CREATED:20260915
DESCRIPTION:This may be your new obsession! Do you love the look of quilts
  and cute fabric but you don’t sew? We have a solution! This may be the 
 most satisfying craft you’ve ever done. Choose from a selection of our i
 n-house kinusaiga patterns and a variety of fabrics. Your piece comes comp
 lete with frame. You can create a fall design or a holiday design. How do 
 you pronounce this? kee-noo-sigh-gah\nJoin us for our Friday Workshops! W
 orkshops run from Friday\, September 25 to December 11\, 6PM to 8PM. Make 
 sure to select your workshop date and the 6:00 timeslot to be signed up. Y
 our project price includes one beverage\; wine\, beer\, coffee\, espresso\
 , hot chocolate or tea (other selections are available) Ages 15+\nSeats li
 mited. You must book ahead. Please note that our workshops are non-refunda
 ble due to limited seating.\nYou must be 21+ to consume alcohol.\n
