DESCRIPTION:Solidarity with Children makes a provocative case for child li
 beration and asks us to rethink what it means to be in relationship with c
 hildren—to care for them\, work with them\, raise them\, and imagine a d
 ifferent kind of solidarity with them.\n\nThis conversation is for parents
 \, educators\, caregivers\, youth workers\, and anyone who wants to interr
 ogate their own relationship to children and the structures that shape it.
