 a-path-to-node="29\,2"><span data-path-to-node="29\,2\,0">Join the <strong
  data-path-to-node="29\,2\,0" data-index-in-node="9">HLS Office of Policy 
 Engagement and Strategic Partnerships</strong> for an exclusive\, off-the-
 record session with a federal <strong data-path-to-node="29\,2\,0" data-in
 dex-in-node="114">Special Agent</strong></span><span data-path-to-node="29
 \,2\,2">. Get direct practitioner insight into how federal agencies audit 
