DESCRIPTION:Learn how to hand knit these super soft chunky knit blankets
 . Make a cozy little lap blanket that’s about 3’ x 3’ and leave with
  the know-how to make your own! They’re the perfect addition to your hom
 e decor. Book ahead for this experience. Your blanket could take anywhere
  from 1 1/2 hours to 2 hours to make. Yarn color options vary based on ava
 ilability.\n
