 f._Global_Indigenous_Studies_1_1.rev.1776968602.jpg" title="Update of Flye
 r 2- 2026 Conf. Global Indigenous Studies - 1" data-max-w="940" data-max-h
 ="788" loading="lazy" data-optimized="true"/></picture><br /><br /><br /><
 /p><p>  &#160\;</p><p>  Conference on Global and Indigenous Studies (CGIS)
  is made possible by the support from:&#160\;</p><div class="float-left on
 e-half"><div class="text"><p><a class="external" href="https://africanstud
 ies.indiana.edu/index.html?_gl=1*4pv3u5*_gcl_au*MTI2NDk4MTcxLjE3NzUwNTYwNj
