  projects. Bring supplies and set up throughout our campus\, spending the 
 days working independently or with others\, however is most fruitful for y
 our creative process. In the evenings\, there will be space for sharing\, 
 collaborating\, and asking for feedback.\n\n\nNovember 13-15\, 2026\n\n\nC
 heck-in: 4-6pm\n\n\nCheck-out: 10am\n\n\n\n\nAges 21+\n\n\nProgram Rates\n
 \n\nAttendance cost is calculated during online registration\, depending o
 n your lodging selection. Rates are per person and include program fees\, 
 lodging and meals.\n\n\nConference Center – Single Occupancy: $350 per p
 erson\n\n\nConference Center – Double Occupancy: $280 per person\n\n\n\n
 \n\n\n
