CREATED:20260915
DESCRIPTION:Learn to throw on the pottery wheel Friday evening. Stop by Sa
 turday morning or Sunday morning to trim and add a handle. Choose your gla
 ze colors and your mug will be shipped to you in 4-6 weeks.\nJoin us for o
 ur Friday Workshops! Workshops run from Friday\, September 25 to December
  11\, 6PM to 8PM. Make sure to select your workshop date and the 6:00 time
 slot to be signed up. Your project price includes one beverage\; wine\, be
 er\, coffee\, espresso\, hot chocolate or tea (other selections are availa
 ble) Ages 15+\nSeats limited. You must book ahead. Please note that our wo
 rkshops are non-refundable due to limited seating.\nYou must be 21+ to con
 sume alcohol.\n
