 governmental and non-governmental organizations. The participants in this 
 conference will be involved in a local and global dialogue and exchange of
  ideas\, research\, and experiences on the themes of the event.</p><p>  Ac
 ross the globe\, ethnic minorities and Indigenous communities have consist
