X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Events Livewhale 64": "https://events.iu.edu/lawiub/event/2404949-lights-on-the-square"}
X-SOURCE-ID:events_livewhale_64
SUMMARY:Lights on the Square
DTSTART:20261211T230000Z
DTEND:20261212T020000Z
DTSTAMP:20260902T093752Z
UID:20261211T230000Z-2404949@events.iu.edu
RECURRENCE-ID:20261211T230000Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260902T133752Z
URL:https://events.iu.edu/lawiub/event/2404949-lights-on-the-square
X-LIVEWHALE-ID:2404949
X-LIVEWHALE-RSVP:1
X-LIVEWHALE-SUMMARY:<p>\n  The Office of Graduate Programs and Global Enga
 gement will host its annual Lights on the Square Reception\, a semi-formal
  event celebrating the end of the semester (and the end of the exchange or
  degree program for some).\n</p>\n<p>\n  Join friends\, law school faculty
  and staff members\, and fellow students and scholars for a night of fun t
 hat includes a photo booth\, social mixers and prize drawings. Delicious a
 nd substantial "finger food" with vegan and gluten free options\, non-alco
 holic beverages\, and beer and wine (available to those over 21) will be s
 erved. Students will receive drink tickets at the door to use on alcohol\,
  after that it will be a cash bar<strong>. Please provide a valid ID.</str
 ong>\n</p>\n<p>\n  All graduate and exchange students and visiting scholar
 s are welcome. Please RSVP no later than December 5th at 4PM to attend. At
 tendees may invite up to two (2) guests if they wish. Please contact <a hr
 ef="mailto:eventlaw@indiana.edu">eventlaw@iu.edu</a> if you would like to 
 invite more than two friends or family members.\n</p>
X-LIVEWHALE-TIMEZONE:America/New_York
X-LIVEWHALE-TYPE:events
X-SOURCE:IU Maurer School of Law
END:VEVENT
