BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-ID:gcal_c_25e52423b2d0772255c59d0e398b655d5c121833814b7b9fc11f4ddd9cff195c_group_calendar_google_com
SUMMARY:Materialism Reading Group
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261217T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261217T203000
DTSTAMP:20260926T045230Z
UID:pmmfg5vpue2vjsu3jcq6grrkdj_R20260528T230000@google.com__20261217
SEQUENCE:1
CREATED:20250810T123130Z
DESCRIPTION:A long-term\, hybrid in-person and online reading group in mem
 ory of our beloved friend\, Joshua Clover inspired by Joshua’s understan
 ding of communism\, and social transformation. \n\nOur itinerary begins w
 ith Riot Strike Riot (Clover) and works backward through Chaos and Governa
 nce in the Modern World System (Arrighi and silver )\, The Eclipse And Re-
 emergence Of The Communist Movement(Dauvé and Martin)\, The Arcana Of Rep
 roduction (Fortunati\, Trans Austin and Colantuono)\, Notes On Dialectics 
 (James)\, Capital V I (Marx\, Trans Reitter or Fowkes) and then returns to
  the present for The Future of Revolution (Bernes). \n\nIf people agree t
 he group will be run as a discussion by rotating facilitators. It could la
 st 18 months or so.
LAST-MODIFIED:20260917T190639Z
LOCATION:Redbud Books\, 408 W Kirkwood Ave\, Bloomington\, IN 47404\, USA
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-SOURCE:Redbud Books
END:VEVENT
