X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<h3>  Experience the <strong><a href="https:
 //hls.indiana.edu/careers/dc-global-policy-program/index.html">Washington
  D.C. Global Policy Program.</a></strong></h3><h4>  Washington DC Summer 
 Practicum</h4><p>  This eight-week intensive summer program for select st
 udents puts you in the middle of it all. Spend five days per week at a fu
 ll-time internship and two nights per week in the classroom at our IU hea
 dquarters at our new IU Capital Campus. This experience cultivates practi
 cal professional skills while helping you build the network critical to a
  successful career in Washington\, D.C.</p><p class="cvGsUA block-font-ke
